+**Checks, two modes (P07-Q2).** `workflow_tools::registered_on(tx, company, tool, mode)`:
+- `Publish` (in `DefinitionPersistence::publish`, `FOR SHARE`): the company's registration of
+  that name pins exactly the snapshot's workflow, version and params, and the version is still
+  selectable. A re-pin or an archive between capture and publish refuses the publication (the
